      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested use: Take AM packet in the morning, preferably with a meal. Take PM packet in the evening, preferably with a meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Each packet contains the following:\nAM Dose \nCal Mag D\nBuild strong bones with Calcium, Magnesium & Vitamin D\nBone Guard\nHelp maintain Calcium for bone strength\nPM Dose\nCal Mag D\nBuild strong bones with Calcium, Magnesium & Vitamin D\nVitamin D\nHelp Calcium absorption for strong bones"
