      "notes": "2 packets a day"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Organic",
      "notes": "Nutrilite is the only brand to grow, harvest, and process plants on our own certified organic farms. By doing so, Nutrilite captures phytonutrients (nutrients from plants) at their peak."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "The phytonutrients in Nutrilite supplements can help fill in for the fruits and vegetables you're likely not getting enough of every day.\nIn order to assure products of the highest quality, all Nutrilite ingredients go through strict quality testing and Nutrilite manages the entire process from seed to finished product. \nSeed Grown on organic farms Harvest Formulate Nutrilite supplements = Quality you can trust"
    },
    {
