      "notes": "Source: Euromonitor International Limited; www.euromonitor.com/amway-claims."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "Children under 12 years of age, pregnant or nursing women or anyone with a medical condition should consult with a physician before using this product."
    },
